{
  "caveats": [
    "This is enterprise-sector classification, which differs from whether an individual job is informal or lacks social protection. These percentages are shares within each district, not each district’s share of all informal workers; they cannot be added or averaged to obtain the national rate. Agricultural employment is excluded. Survey estimates have sampling uncertainty. Only 2025 is included, so the data does not establish a trend. Original district spellings are retained beside standardised labels.",
    "The source uses .. for unavailable figures and a dash for nil or negligible. Both retain their printed token and a distinct status; neither is converted to an exact zero."
  ],
