  "grain": "One district or national informal-sector share of non-agricultural employment in 2025",
  "notes": [
    "The 2025 Labour Force Survey annual report provides one national percentage and 25 district percentages for employed people aged 15 and over. Non-agricultural employment covers industry and services. The source classifies enterprises using registration, formal accounts and the number of regular employees. The report says 2025 estimates were reweighted using the 2024 Census population estimates."
  ],
